"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122136208941359074%20-%20%0A%09This%20past%20Thursday%2C%20I%20had%20the%20opportunity%20to%20speak%20at%20another%20important%20forum.%20This%20event%20was%20hosted%20by%20the%20Minnesota%20Transportation%20Alliance.It%20was%20a%20great%20opportunity%20to%20answer%20questions%20and%20have%20meaningful%20conversations%20about%20transportation%20funding%20at%20both%20the%20local%20and%20state%20levels.The%20discussion%20covered%20several%20important%20topics%2C%20including%20where%20transportation%20funding%20comes%20from%2C%20what%20factors%20impact%20road%20and%20infrastructure%20projects%2C%20wetland%20replacement%20challenges%2C%20and%20more.It%E2%80%99s%20always%20valuable%20to%20hear%20directly%20from%20county%20engineers%20and%20MnDOT%20representatives%20who%20work%20with%20these%20issues%20firsthand.Thank%20you%20to%20the%20Minnesota%20Transportation%20Alliance%20for%20hosting%20and%20to%20everyone%20who%20participated%20in%20the%20conversation%21www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg%20%23MNSenate%20%23District13%20%23MNPolitics%20%23Vote2026%20%23MNVotes%20%23GOP%20%23GapinskiforMNSenate%20%09%0A%09"
