"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122136899049359074%20-%20%0A%09A%20little%20friendly%20competition%20and%20some%20great%20chili%20sounds%20like%20a%20perfect%20Sunday%20afternoon%21I%E2%80%99m%20looking%20forward%20to%20joining%20Tanja%20Goering%20as%20a%20guest%20judge%20for%20the%20Watkins%20Lions%20Club%E2%80%99s%20First%20Annual%20Chili%20Cook-Off%21Come%20on%20out%20to%20The%20Store%20Saloon%20in%20St.%20Nick%20this%20Sunday%2C%20October%2018th%2C%20from%201%E2%80%933%20PM%20for%20some%20delicious%20chili%2C%20good%20company%2C%20and%20community%20fun%21Hope%20to%20see%20you%20there%21%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%B8THIS%20SUNDAY%21%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8FGet%20ready%20for%20the%20First%20Annual%20Chili%20Cook-Off%20at%20the%20Store%20Saloon%21%20Whether%20you%27re%20a%20chili%20recipe%20master%20or%20you%20just%20love%20to%20eat%20the%20stuff%2C%20come%20on%20out%20this%20Sunday%20starting%20at%201%20for%20Sunday%20Funday%20with%20Mike%2C%20Rose%20and%20us.%20There%27s%20loads%20of%20fun%20things%20going%20on%20all%20day.%20%28See%20comments%20below%20for%20chili%20cook-off%20rules%21%29%F0%9F%93%8D%20The%20Vikes%20don%27t%20play%2C%20but%20other%20games%20will%20be%20shown%20starting%20at%20noon.%F0%9F%93%8D%20Chili%20sampling%20begins%20at%201pm.%F0%9F%93%8D%20Judging%20will%20be%20complete%20at%203pm%20-%20we%20need%20your%20help%20with%20this%21%20%F0%9F%93%8D%20Speaking%20of%20judging%2C%20we%20will%20have%20some%20sweet%20guest%20judges%20joining%20us%20-%20Tanja%20Goering%20for%20MN%20and%20Jared%20Gapinski%20For%20MN%20Senate%2013%21%F0%9F%93%8D%20Starting%20at%203pm%2C%20the%20Lions%20will%20be%20slinging%20meat%20raffle%20meat%20plus%20we%27ll%20be%20running%20horse%20races%20for%20BIG%20CASH%20and%20%245%20tip%20boards%20for%20%2425%20and%20%2490%20prizes%20every%20round.To%20sign%20up%20to%20participate%20in%20the%20Chili%20Cook-Off%2C%20please%20text%20Jenny%20at%20320-223-3602.%20Entry%20fee%20is%20%2410.And%20honestly%2C%20if%20you%20have%20not%20yet%20become%20a%20massive%20fan%20of%20the%20hand-crafted%20cocktails%20that%20Mike%20and%20Rose%20have%20made%20famous%2C%20one%20sip%20and%20you%27ll%20be%20HOOKED.%20Old%20Fashioneds%2C%20Bee%27s%20Knees%20and%20more%2C%20handcrafted%20right%20in%20front%20of%20you.%20We%27ll%20see%20you%20Sunday.%20%20%09%0A%09"
},
